:: Carter Hero Award Intro Part 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> walk back out into the hallway, <span style="Color: LightGreen"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> still wiping his eyes on his shirt as he turns away from you, feeling a tad embarrassed to be tearing up at the idea of getting a reward.</span> You chuckle at the sight, slightly teasing him about it but saying that he does deserve it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You think so?”</span> <span style="Color: Pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> asks shyly, unable to hide his cute little smile,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I mean, I’m happy and excited, but it feels weird. Like, I don’t do all this stuff because I want a reward or anything, I just like helping people. But… it’s hard not to feel a little excited.”</span> He laughs. <br>

