You know <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> well enough to know he is being honest about not doing this for rewards or accolades, but you can also tell that he feels giddy over the idea of getting recognition like this. Getting not just an award, but THE award of the show. The main event. It would be weird if he wasn’t a bundle of nerves and excitement. As you two begin to walk back to class, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> who he was on the phone with when you walked in. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, you saw that?”</span> He replies, rubbing the back of his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“My dad. He knew about the whole thing since the police captain was on the board for it. He wanted me to call him as soon as I found out, it was embarrassing. Haha.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suddenly stops, turning to you with a smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! I almost forgot! When I was on the phone, dad said he was going to buy a big tub of my favorite ice cream after school! A little congratulations gift.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s mouth is already watering just at the thought of his favorite sugary treat, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And he hinted that I could bring a friend over. Sooo…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> rotates back and forth cutely, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wanna come over for ice cream after school? You could get off at my stop and dad could take you home after.”</span> <br>
<br>
You pretend to think it over for a long minute, but it’s hard to turn down free ice cream and a celebratory hangout with your friend, so you agree! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Great! I’ll see you at the bus stop! The ice cream dad buys is like super high quality, you’ll love it!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> giggles and bounces as you two continue down the hallway. The boy is practically flowing with joy at the moment.</span> <br>
